		{"kind": "arena", "style": "titan", "id": "world.aldmere.warden_territory", "pos": [705, 222], "inner_radius": 95, "engage_area": "world.area.warden_yard", "engage": {"at": [703, 230], "size": [60, 30, 44], "yaw": 0}, "boss_id": "world.aldmere.bastion", "encounter_id": "encounter.aldmere_bastion", "defeated_flag": "boss.bastion.defeated", "territory_m": 80, "region_id": "region.aldmere", "discover_poi": "poi.warden_keep", "reopened_flag": "world.warden_keep.opened", "disengage_s": 6, "disengage_margin_m": 20, "wake_on_sight": false, "note": "C2: the Broken Warden's territory (TitanTerritory). He stands asleep in the breach of the keep's north curtain: a giant he sees from the road only discovers the keep; a giant who walks into the yard (or strikes him) wakes him, and he hunts it to 115 m of the yard (never down onto the King's Road: the toll fort is 240 m off, the war camp 210 m) and walks home whole after a disengage. Once he has fallen and the giant has gone on, the masons come up the old road and the keep is opened (world.warden_keep.opened)."},
